{"version":1,"key":"card:602","content":{"id":602,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"在 JavaScript 中，","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"Symbol","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"90deb447-9673-4fdc-9d41-e2e7466f1754","contentId":240,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":249,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":" 表示运行时的唯一值，在 TypeScript 中使用 symbol 这一类型来进行标注","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"51368af9-6d21-4aa5-bf5d-17947d8ff623","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const sym: symbol = Symbol(\"foo\")","collabId":"b31d7a43-2be3-4573-99b7-b8374d1e672b","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"d772e31d-60e8-48b2-af00-9ccbd270c3aa","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"ab6667e1-6ff2-4d67-8c83-7fb5ff090f64"},{"children":[{"text":"但是存在的一个问题就是，所有的 Symbol 变量都是同一数据类型，为了实现独一无二的特性，TypeScript 提供了 unique symbol 这一类型，每一个 unique symbol 类型都是不同的，不可以互相赋值","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f185c46f-d9df-43fa-ba4d-984af5d6acf6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const uq1: unique symbol = Symbol()\nconst uq2: unique symbol = uq1; // 类型不兼容","collabId":"644db2ff-010c-4795-8bfb-fecabbcf0a8d","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"4a061777-ceae-40a2-9e59-deaeec174c33","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"3ab134e9-df65-4b07-8fc2-1cdda5b058d6"},{"children":[{"text":"在 JavaScript 中通过使用 Symbol.for 来复用已有的 Symbol，在 TypeScript 中想复用 unique symbol 类型只能使用 typeof 运算符","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e671d0fe-e548-4664-b7d3-73e0071842b9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const uq1: unique symbol = Symbol()\nconst uq2: typeof uq1 = uq1;","collabId":"7e18df7d-30a6-46ed-badc-111958f34da6","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"35e1916b-9408-4370-8984-353e26d21201","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"06825380-dd2c-4266-8164-674fd101d220"}],"tags":["TypeScript/unique symbol"],"createTime":1753058327899,"updateTime":1793532564276,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532564276},"links":{"card:249":{"key":"card:249","type":"card","id":249}}}